# Workflow Reference (Updated — Agentic Engineering, Verified Skills)
# Skills verified at ~/.agents/skills/: scope, architect, audit, check, debug, develop, test, document, sync.
# Workflow discipline (no synthetic artifacts, real verification, state in files):
# 1. Plan: /scope → docs/scope/
# 2. Design: /architect → docs/specs/
# 3. Build: /develop (reads spec + AGENTS.md; stops on missing decision → routes to architect)
# 4. Verify: /check verify (drive real app; /check review reads diff with fresh model)
# 5. Test: /test (tests for what a caller relies on; happy path + edge + error + accessibility)
# 6. Document: /document (pr | changelog | release-note | postmortem from real diff)
# 7. Fix root cause: /debug (reproduce → localize → one hypothesis → minimal fix → regression test)
# 8. Reconcile state: /sync (update AGENTS.md, reconcile scope, flag stale specs; surgical edits only)
